title: file-manager:select
tags: [[GUI command]] [[file-manager panel]]
kind: reference
summary: File manager: change the checked multi-selection (toggle / all / none)

Changes the checked selection from the [[file-manager panel]]: `toggle` checks or unchecks the entry under the cursor, `all` checks every entry of the directory on top of what is already checked, `none` unchecks everything. A tracked entry is checked by its metarecord, into the set shared with the [[metarecord-list panel]]; an untracked one by its path, into `selected_untracked_paths` ([[Cross-panel selection]]).
